## 1. Project Status

**Nami** is an ocean-themed Pomodoro study dashboard. The project is a full-stack application
(React frontend + Django backend) designed for solo and collaborative focus sessions.

**Current development stage: Early-to-mid frontend development.**

The frontend is actively being rebuilt with a new ocean-themed design. The original backend
(Django REST + WebSocket) and the original frontend (auth pages, rooms, friends) have been
fully archived into `_archive/`. The current codebase is a fresh frontend-only build running
on mock data, with the backend shell still in place but all Django apps commented out.

