## 3. Feature Descriptions

### Timer Engine — `useTimer.js` [COMPLETED]
- Full Pomodoro countdown: Focus (25m), Short Break (5m), Long Break (15m)
- Start, pause, resume, reset, mode switch
- Progress calculation (0–1), formatted time (MM:SS)
- Session counting per mode, completion callback
- Document title updates while running
- Implemented in: `frontend/src/hooks/useTimer.js`

### Session History — `useSessionHistory.js` [COMPLETED]
- Records completed sessions to `localStorage` (key: `nami.sessionHistory`)
- Groups sessions by day, calculates daily streak
- Aggregate stats: total sessions, total focus minutes, streak
- Max 200 sessions stored
- Implemented in: `frontend/src/hooks/useSessionHistory.js`
- **Data is local only — no backend persistence**

### Sky Theme — `useSkyTheme.js` [COMPLETED]
- Dynamic CSS gradient based on user's local time of day
- 4 themes: Night (8pm–5am), Dawn (5am–8am), Day (8am–5pm), Dusk (5pm–8pm)
- Updates every 60 seconds
- Implemented in: `frontend/src/hooks/useSkyTheme.js`

### Audio System — `useAudio.js` [COMPLETED]
- Web Audio API — generates tones programmatically (no audio files needed)
- Completion chime: 3-tone ascending (C5, E5, G5)
- Tick sound function (available but not actively called by timer)
- Respects sound enabled/disabled toggle from Settings
- Implemented in: `frontend/src/hooks/useAudio.js`

### Background Music — `Music.jsx` [COMPLETED]
- HTML5 Audio element with real external audio URLs (Pixabay CDN)
- 4 tracks: Ocean Waves, Calm Piano, Rain, Ambient + None
- Volume slider, loop playback, track switching
- Now-playing indicator in navbar and panel
- Implemented in: `frontend/src/components/Music/Music.jsx`

### Keyboard Shortcuts — `useKeyboardShortcuts.js` [COMPLETED]
- Space: Start/Pause/Resume, R: Reset, Esc: Close panel
- 1/2/3: Switch mode (only when not running)
- Disabled when typing in input/textarea
- Implemented in: `frontend/src/hooks/useKeyboardShortcuts.js`

### Ocean + Boat Scene [COMPLETED]
- 4-layer SVG wave animation with foam highlights
- Waves animate when timer is running (`ocean-alive` class)
- Boat SVG moves left→right based on timer progress (8%–88%)
